OL,3,GEast                                   
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with outbreaks of rain   
OL,6,Flingering across northern areas,       
OL,7,Fperhaps locally heavy this morning,    
OL,8,Fwith drier spells developing this      
OL,9,Fafternoon. Further south staying       
OL,10,Fmainly dry, generally cloudy but with  
OL,11,Fsome bright or sunny spells.           
OL,13,CTonight:FOvercast with outbreaks of    
OL,14,Fmainly light rain, although southern   
OL,15,Fareas are likely to be dry at first    
OL,16,Fwith possibly some temporary clear     
OL,17,Fspells and patchy mist or fog.         
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
