OL,3,GEast                                   
OL,5,CFriday:FLargely cloudy morning with    
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain slowly moving away   
OL,7,Fsouthwards. Drier conditions will      
OL,8,Ffollow, along with bright or sunny     
OL,9,Fspells for some areas, and perhaps     
OL,10,Fisolated coastal showers.              
OL,12,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FDry    
OL,13,Fwith sunny spells, apart for possibly  
OL,14,Fisolated coastal showers Saturday.     
OL,15,FOvernight frosts, with potentially     
OL,16,Fpatchy freezing mist or fog.           
OL,17,FTemperatures near or slightly below    
OL,18,Fnormal.                                
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
